        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khebulila Omubuumbi wowo mu ndaalo che buele bwowo, chindaalo chimbi ne chisiili khwola tawe, ne kimiiko ne kikhembiya tawe. Mu miiko ekio oliloma oli, “Ese se ndi ne busangaafu mu menako tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biise ebio nibio enyanga ne buwaanga ne kumwesi, ne ching'enieesi bikhamaliyilekho, ne kamafuumbi kakhakobole enyuma we fula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ndaalo echo, baliindi be chinju bakhatereme, babaandu be kamaani baliinamikha, ne bakhasi basia mureko balilekha sikila bali batiiti. Abo balolela mu matirisia balibona sisiilimalima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne oliloota mungo mwowo mwa mindali na mindali. Ne babaandu baliicha kamasika kowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwilwachi aloma ali, bukhala mbamo, bukhala mbamo. Bioosi bukhala mbamo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khumaliilisia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khurusiakho omwilwachi khuuba owe limanya, ekisia babaandu bukesi. Aapiima chisimo chingali, acheyika ne khuchingoona bulayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwilwachi akhaka khuyiima kamakhuwa ke khusiimisia, aandika mu busicha kamakhuwa ke bung'ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilomaloma lie babaandu bakesi lili nga esiimbo eye khukhwayila, ne chisimo chichabuusibwa chili nga chimenya nga kimisumari kikiakhomwa kialuma, chichaama khu Wele, Omwaayi mulala owefwe fwesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wase, khukhila koosi, yiiyaya! Khuandika bitabu se khuli ne sisiakamo tawe, ne khusoma khukali khuluya kumubili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa kano koosi, siliio sisiindu silala poli nisio ndoma sili sino: Ria Wele, mala otiile kamalaka kewe, sikila omundu abuumbwa khulwe bibieene ebio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila Wele acha khukhalakila buli sisiindu nisio khukhola, sibeele silayi namwe sibi, akhaba bibiindu bibiikholekhela mu bwikisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
